    "note": "Signed act (05/30/2025), takes effect Jan 1, 2026 (subject to referendum petition). Section 1 (resident-bidder preference, C.R.S. 24-103-906) is a cross-reference change and is not quoted. Other items in (3)(a)(III)-(VIII) (trace-request disclosure, theft/loss records, inspection reports, anti-straw-purchase policies) are omitted from the quote for length."
